      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "之后我们回到学园……\n然后菱亚马逊拜托我在训练员室等她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "36bd466886926bb00756b102b7a45bcb010cd6cf0bac02f9c4bbd0c0360de4d3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
